">Relaxed</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">);</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">                    }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">                }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">                ignore</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">WalkState</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">Continue</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">            })</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">        });</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">    println!</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"{} files\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, count</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">load</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">Ordering</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">Relaxed</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">));</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">    Ok</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(())</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">}</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">fn</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\"> num_cpus</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">() </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">-></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> usize</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">    std</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">thread</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">available_parallelism</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">()</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">map</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">|</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">n</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">|</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> n</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">get</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">())</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">unwrap_or</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><code>build_parallel</code> plus a closure factory looks odd until you see why: the <code>run</code>\nargument is called once per worker thread, so each thread gets its own closure\nwith its own state. That is how you parallelise without a mutex.</p>\n<h2 id=\"the-rules-that-make-a-tool-feel-professional\">The rules that make a tool feel professional</h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"rust\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"rust\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">use</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> std</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">io</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">IsTerminal</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">// 1. colour only when a human is watching</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">let</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> colour </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> std</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">io</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">stdout</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">()</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">is_terminal</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">() </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> std</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">env</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">var_os</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"NO_COLOR\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">)</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">is_none</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">();</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">// 2. data on stdout, everything else on stderr</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">eprintln!</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"scanning {} files…\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, n);   </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">// progress</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">println!</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"{json}\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">);                    </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">// data</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">// 3. exit codes that scripts can branch on</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">//    0 = success, 1 = \"no match\" (not an error), 2 = real error</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">std</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">process</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">ExitCode</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">from</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">if</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> hits </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> { </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> } </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">else</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> { </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> });</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Those three lines are the difference between a tool that composes and a tool that\nhas to be babysat.</p>\n<h2 id=\"what-to-steal-for-your-own-project\">What to steal for your own project</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Budget the startup.</strong> <code>hyperfine './target/release/tool --help'</code> — if it is\nover 20 ms, something is doing work at startup that should be lazy.</li>\n<li><strong>Ship one static binary.</strong> <code>--target x86_64-unknown-linux-musl</code> removes glibc\nfrom the equation entirely.</li>\n<li><strong>Respect the conventions you inherited</strong>: <code>--help</code>, <code>--version</code>, <code>-q</code>, <code>-v</code>,\n<code>--json</code>, <code>NO_COLOR</code>, stdin when no file is given. Users have muscle memory.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"where-rust-is-the-wrong-answer\">Where Rust is the wrong answer</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A tool that spends 95% of its time waiting on an HTTP API — the language is\nirrelevant, use whatever ships fastest.</li>\n<li>Plugins: a Rust tool with a Rust-only plugin API has a much smaller plugin\necosystem than one with a scripting language. (This is why several Rust tools\nembed Lua or WASM for extensions.)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"try-it\">Try it</h2>\n<p>Run <code>hyperfine --warmup 3 'grep -r TODO src' 'rg TODO src'</code> on any repo over\n50 MB. Then read ripgrep's <code>searcher</code> crate — it is the best example in the\necosystem of turning a simple idea into a fast one without making it unreadable.</p>\n<p><strong>Next:</strong> <a href=\"03-data-and-streaming.md\">Data and streaming</a></p>"}